  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Finance Accelerator (CDEL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Finance Accelerator project will aim to achieve the following objectives. 1). Uganda&apos;s pipeline of &apos;bankable&apos; projects is strengthened. 2). Ugandan, regional and London-based investors increase the flow of financing  (including trade financing) to green Ugandan businesses, particularly Small and Medium Enterprises, agriculture and women-owned businesses. 3). There is a strengthened enabling environment for green investment in Uganda</narrative>
  </description>
